This extension bundles PdfCraft's official web build, unmodified:

  pdfcraft/pdfcraft-web-<hash>.js and pdfcraft/pdfcraft-web-<hash>_bg.wasm
  from https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft/releases/tag/v0.8.0 (pdfcraft-web-0.8.0.zip,
  SHA-256 1f9ea51f3c1f71cc719c12814e10f236912fa41ef54a7782c7dd4a619d9eee9a)
  Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the PdfCraft contributors. MIT OR Apache-2.0.
  Its own notice, which lists the third-party material compiled into it, is pdfcraft/NOTICE,
  with pdfcraft/LICENSE-MIT and pdfcraft/LICENSE-APACHE.

Licence texts for third-party material named in pdfcraft/NOTICE are in licenses/:
  - Inter, JetBrains Mono and Dancing Script typefaces: SIL Open Font License 1.1
    (OFL-Inter.txt, OFL-JetBrainsMono.txt, OFL-DancingScript.txt)
  - Foxit standard-14 substitute fonts (in hayro): BSD-3-Clause (LICENSE-Foxit-BSD-3-Clause.txt)

Extension assets:
  - icons/pdfcraft-*.png: the PdfCraft app icon (PdfCraft assets/app-icon/hicolor), original
    artwork licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0 (icons/LICENSE-pdfcraft-icon.txt).
  - icons/ui.svg: Lucide icons (https://lucide.dev, as bundled by PdfCraft), ISC License
    (icons/LICENSE-lucide.txt).

